process main⦅⦆ → int64 ⟦
    @qhal_backend sim
    qubit q0 ⸴ q1 ·
    superpose q0 ·
    entangle q0 ⸴ q1 ·

    text qiskit_code ↦ "" ·
    transpile_to "qiskit" into qiskit_code with size 2048 ·
    emit qiskit_code ·

    text cirq_code ↦ "" ·
    transpile_to "cirq" into cirq_code with size 2048 ·
    emit cirq_code ·

    yield 0 ·
⟧
